  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilient Communities: Health Responses to Climate Change in Fiji</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cure Kids NZ and Live and Learn Fiji will&#xa0;support community mitigation and adaptation efforts,&#xa0;increases climate-health knowledge and promotes resilient initiatives related to air quality and respiratory health. Fiji&apos;s community health workforce will be equipped to effectively respond to the impacts of climate change; healthcare facilities will become more resilient with solar power installations; and Fiji&apos;s Adaptation Plan will be informed by findings generated from this activity.</narrative>
  </description>
